{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Bound pending data by bytes, not only execution count.** Records enter `_pending` before per-exporter truncation, so a blocked exporter can retain 1,024 raw, potentially multi-megabyte snapshots. A warm container can exhaust memory long before reaching this count, allowing an exporter failure to terminate the workflow. Enforce a total pending-byte budget or queue an already bounded representation, and add a blocked-exporter test using large records.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7s2ucV","finding_digest":"ea6c1cf3405a9df9ac9ecf0e969171cbe08e51ef48754894a52ee1a6db3c26bc","finding_id":"arf_v1_5jwbz42alko7tle6z4hjnelrzp","finding_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane._pending::unbounded-record-bytes","identity_key":"insight/_export_scheduler.py::_exporterlane._pending::unbounded-record-bytes","line":40,"observation_digest":"20d5a0a3d20376d45cf0d96f6cbbc86a9f8cb97dfee35b4e340c5ea5037c1892","observation_id":"aro_v1_edk2bi6san3nixhq3fxwzo6ink","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/_export_scheduler.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-09T22:57:46Z","review_id":"arr_v1_5nvcmqix5ttypqfg3wav5ho3j2","reviewed_base_sha":"630b7771cedb1cf561e6ac29d49b84b6291db6b4","reviewed_head_sha":"603743098a751bab770351ace63cbb734f926782","reviewer":"codex","start_line":40,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":702},"record_id":"art_v1_d2t47hogwkzn36zd6liygdslcn","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-09T22:57:46Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
